        "original_id": "c9e21c81-1495-5101-b572-2f34f4b0a50a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Worldview Entertainment\n- Products: Child 44, Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, Handsome Harry\n- People: Daniel Espinosa, Richard Price, Tom Rob Smith, Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, Aidan Quinn\n- Topics: film production, film finance\n\nFacts:\n- Worldview Entertainment is an American independent motion picture company that finances and produces theatrical-quality feature films for worldwide distribution.\n- Handsome Harry was the first project produced by Worldview Entertainment, and it stars Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, and Aidan Quinn.\n- Worldview Entertainment has produced films including Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, and Child 44.\n- Child 44 is a 2015 mystery thriller film directed by Daniel Espinosa, written by Richard Price, and based on Tom Rob Smith's 2008 novel of the same name.",
